{"root":"jernih","ipa":"/dʒərnih/","core":"清澈的，透明的；清晰的，明朗的（指思想、声音或视线）。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/dʒərnih/","zh":"清澈的，透明的；清晰的","phrases":[{"t":"air jernih","zh":"清澈的水"},{"t":"pikiran jernih","zh":"清晰的头脑"},{"t":"suara jernih","zh":"清晰的声音"}],"examples":[{"t":"Air sungai itu sangat jernih.","zh":"那条河的水非常清澈。"},{"t":"Dia berpikir dengan jernih sebelum mengambil keputusan.","zh":"他在做决定前进行了冷静清晰的思考。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"jernih","ipa":"/dʒərnih/","zh":"清澈的","phrase":{"t":"mata jernih","zh":"明亮的眼睛"},"example":{"t":"Kolam itu tampak jernih.","zh":"那个池塘看起来很清澈。"}},{"w":"menjernihkan","ipa":"/mən.dʒər.nih.kan/","zh":"使清澈，澄清","phrase":{"t":"menjernihkan suasana","zh":"澄清局势/缓和气氛"},"example":{"t":"Dia mencoba menjernihkan air yang keruh itu.","zh":"他试图澄清那浑浊的水。"}},{"w":"penjernih","ipa":"/pən.dʒər.nih/","zh":"澄清剂，净化器","phrase":{"t":"penjernih air","zh":"净水器"},"example":{"t":"Alat ini berfungsi sebagai penjernih air.","zh":"这个设备起到了净水器的作用。"}},{"w":"kejernihan","ipa":"/kə.dʒər.ni.han/","zh":"清澈度，清晰度","phrase":{"t":"kejernihan air","zh":"水的清澈度"},"example":{"t":"Kejernihan suaranya sangat mengagumkan.","zh":"他声音的清晰度令人赞叹。"}}],"derSlugs":["jernih","menjernihkan","penjernih","kejernihan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:25:36.718Z","src":"base"}